<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila firm seeks to buy 16,000T of U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>Manila firm seeks to buy 16,000T of U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manila traders said on Tuesday another Philippine firm wanted to buy 16,000 tonnes of U.S. wheat for November shipment.</p>
<p>One trading company said the milling company asked for price quotations earlier today. No other details were disclosed.  </p>
<p>Earlier, a flour mill had invited tenders for 10,000 tonnes of combined dark northern spring wheat and western white wheat also for November shipment.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418936 fax 8176267</p>
